changes.before_claim:
Archiving preserves:

- Version.
- Updated At.

Archiving alone does not create a new version.

```CFEL
Atom.Status{:1}: [string]{:1};
Atom.Status.*[]{:0};
Atom.Status: Draft;
Atom.Status: Active;
Atom.Status: Archived
```

