changes.before_claim:
Updated At records the actual Project-time instant of the accepted edit represented by the Atom. An exact no-op and an archived predecessor retain the prior timestamp.

```CFEL
Atom.Updated At{:1}: [datetime]{:1};
Atom.Updated At.*[]{:0}
```

